{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":501517,"name":"a8d1binbox","username":"Tibetan95380","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/t/e19b73/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-26T10:06:29.725Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501517-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501517-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501517-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501517-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery message fails with: Bot failed to respond. Something went wrong while generating the reply. Try again.\u003cbr\u003e\nWindows Grok Bot 0.59.1 (DESKTOP-ANNETTE). Pacific Time. Saturday, September 26, 2026, 1:29 AM through 2:27 AM. Also failing for several days before that.\u003cbr\u003e\nThe app shows “Bot is working,” then the red error. Even “hello” fails.\u003cbr\u003e\nAlready tried:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRestart to Update to 0.59.1\u003cbr\u003e\nUpdate Grok Bot’s Computer (finished)\u003cbr\u003e\nReset Grok Bot’s Computer once (finished)\u003cbr\u003e\nSent hello again after Reset\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSame error. Chat history is still visible. Weekly usage was about 30%, not the limit.\u003cbr\u003e\nPlease recover my Grok Bot computer from your side. Do not delete my Bots or chats.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501517-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501517-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpen Grok Bot on Windows.\u003cbr\u003e\nOpen the existing Bot chat.\u003cbr\u003e\nSend hello.\u003cbr\u003e\nThe red error appears: Bot failed to respond. Something went wrong while generating the reply. Try again.\u003cbr\u003e\nSettings → Updates → Restart to Update to 0.59.1. Send hello again. Same error.\u003cbr\u003e\nSettings → Updates → Update Grok Bot’s Computer. Wait until it says the computer is on the latest version. Send hello again. Same error.\u003cbr\u003e\nSettings → Updates → Reset Grok Bot’s Computer once. Wait until it finishes. Send hello again. Same error.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501517-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501517-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bot should answer hello with a normal reply. The old chat should keep working after Update or Reset.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501517-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501517-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/d/3/d3dcaea33146cedf9c682bc8e25b6aefc1f73e10.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/uedyrUT3WFLufjgL9H8YT0ZVxMA.png?dl=1\" title=\"GrokBot fails to respond after multiple tries.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/3/d3dcaea33146cedf9c682bc8e25b6aefc1f73e10_2_672x500.png\" alt=\"GrokBot fails to respond after multiple tries.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"uedyrUT3WFLufjgL9H8YT0ZVxMA\" width=\"672\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/3/d3dcaea33146cedf9c682bc8e25b6aefc1f73e10_2_672x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/3/d3dcaea33146cedf9c682bc8e25b6aefc1f73e10_2_1008x750.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/d/3/d3dcaea33146cedf9c682bc8e25b6aefc1f73e10.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"E5E5E7\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eGrokBot fails to respond after multiple tries.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1152×856 28.2 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501517-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501517-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501517-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501517-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot: 0.59.1\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRelease Track: Stable\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOS: Windows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComputer name: DESKTOP-ANNETTE\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501517-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501517-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eModel name: Grok Bot default (unknown)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501517-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501517-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo request ID shown. Failed messages never showed a request ID.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501517-additional-information-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501517-additional-information-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease recover my Grok Bot computer from your side. Do not delete my Bots or chats. Norton is on this PC. I already Reset once tonight. The old chat is still visible. He has not answered for several days.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501517-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501517-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-26T10:06:35.552Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":26,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":131.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":173045,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-failed-to-respond-after-update-and-reset-windows-0-59-1","display_username":"a8d1binbox","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":139875,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-failed-to-respond-after-update-and-reset-windows-0-59-1/173045/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":501536,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-26T10:25:23.965Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report and the list of things you already tried.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGood news: your Grok Bot computer is fine. There’s nothing to restore there, and Update or Reset won’t help. The issue is tied to one specific chat. Something in that chat history, likely an image that was added earlier, causes a crash on every new message, even “hello”. That’s why the error comes back after any Reset. That chat state is stored on our side.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat you can do right now to avoid being blocked: create a new Bot or start a new chat and use that. Your second bot replies normally, so a new one should work too. You don’t need to delete the old bot or old chats. They’re safe, and you won’t lose anything.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’ve shared this with the team so we can get that chat working again. I’ll reply here when there’s an update.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-26T10:25:23.965Z","reply_count":3,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":15.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":173045,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-failed-to-respond-after-update-and-reset-windows-0-59-1","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-failed-to-respond-after-update-and-reset-windows-0-59-1/173045/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":501545,"name":"a8d1binbox","username":"Tibetan95380","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/t/e19b73/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-26T10:38:13.000Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi, Dean,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you for the information. I don’t really want to use a new Bot. I’d rather wait for you to fix the problem with Grok Bot itself.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIs that OK? How long would it take the team to fix the chat to make it work again?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you so much.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnnette D Buttress\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-26T10:38:54.664Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":5,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":1.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":173045,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-failed-to-respond-after-update-and-reset-windows-0-59-1","display_username":"a8d1binbox","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":750,"username":"deanrie","name":"Dean Rie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":139875,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"via_email":true,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-failed-to-respond-after-update-and-reset-windows-0-59-1/173045/7","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":501549,"name":"a8d1binbox","username":"Tibetan95380","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/t/e19b73/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-26T10:45:16.000Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi Dean,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe only images I’ve sent are of spreadsheets, and I don’t think they were sent as IMAGES per se…\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnnette\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":8,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-26T10:45:56.033Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":5,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":1.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":173045,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-failed-to-respond-after-update-and-reset-windows-0-59-1","display_username":"a8d1binbox","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":750,"username":"deanrie","name":"Dean Rie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":139875,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"via_email":true,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-failed-to-respond-after-update-and-reset-windows-0-59-1/173045/8","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":501551,"name":"a8d1binbox","username":"Tibetan95380","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/t/e19b73/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-26T10:56:11.000Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi again, Dean,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes, I sent several screenshots of spreadsheets, and there was never a problem.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis was the \u003cstrong\u003elast reply\u003c/strong\u003e I received from Grok Bot, most likely on 24th September, 2026, probably about 3AM - 4AM:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSENT BY ME:\u003c/strong\u003e Nope lines there now. Thank you so much, GrokBot - will come back to this when I get back from doctor. Nite xoxo\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGROK BOT’S REPLY:\u003c/strong\u003e Glad they’re showing. Hope the appointment goes well — we’ll pick this up when you’re back. Nite xoxo\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd this was \u003cstrong\u003eSEVERAL SENDS AND REPLIES AFTER\u003c/strong\u003e I had entered this screenshot as an IMAGE, probably a couple of hours earlier:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/2/6/26eaeba0310b0b77583bc434ec2deb6c7f0830d4.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"5yhsqD7i3oHFo9G9yBYdZARqTxW\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"459\" height=\"13\" data-dominant-color=\"DEDCD1\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo this could have been the ONLY IMAGE before Grok Bot stopped replying, and it’s NOT a HUGE IMAGE that would affect Grok Bot being able to reply, so I’m absolutely flummoxed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnnette Buttress\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":9,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-26T10:56:56.003Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":5,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":6.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":173045,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-failed-to-respond-after-update-and-reset-windows-0-59-1","display_username":"a8d1binbox","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":750,"username":"deanrie","name":"Dean Rie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":139875,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"via_email":true,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-failed-to-respond-after-update-and-reset-windows-0-59-1/173045/9","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":501603,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-26T13:38:39.347Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for sending the screenshot of the table, that helps.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAbout the image, the limit here isn’t the file size, it’s the image dimensions in pixels. Table screenshots often end up very wide, several thousand pixels across, even if they look like a thin strip. Because of that, one of the images in this chat history is over the maximum allowed size, and every new request in this chat hits that limit, so even “hello” fails. Update and Reset don’t help because this chat’s history is stored on our side.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn timing, I honestly can’t give an exact date. I’ve passed this to the team and we’ll reply here as soon as we have an update.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWaiting is also totally fine. Your bots and all history are safe, nothing is being deleted. The only downside is that this specific chat will stay stuck for now. If you want to use Grok Bot in the meantime, the fastest option is to start a new chat, you can use the same bot, just without that wide image. You don’t need to touch the old chat.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":10,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-26T13:38:39.347Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":9,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":0.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":173045,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-failed-to-respond-after-update-and-reset-windows-0-59-1","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","reply_to_user":{"id":139875,"username":"Tibetan95380","name":"a8d1binbox","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/t/e19b73/{size}.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-failed-to-respond-after-update-and-reset-windows-0-59-1/173045/10","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":501656,"name":"Colin","username":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-26T14:59:40.408Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/tibetan95380\"\u003e@Tibetan95380\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCan you check to see if it’s working now?\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":11,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-26T14:59:40.408Z","rep